; Runtime errors of interfaces (--mode=objfpc): a failed `as`, and a call
; through a nil interface (under range checks).
; RUN: %p3 --mode=objfpc %S/Inputs/interfaces/rterrors.pas -o %t
; RUN: not %t as 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=AS %s
; AS: TA.P
; AS-NEXT: Runtime error: invalid interface typecast at {{.*}}rterrors.pas:19:12
; RUN: not %t nil 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=NIL %s
; NIL: Runtime error: use of a nil interface reference at {{.*}}rterrors.pas:23:7
